    "\r",
    "* feat(routing): add tests for searchbox\r",
    "\r",
    "* feat(routing): add tests for sortBy\r",
    "\r",
    "* feat(routing): add tests for star rating\r",
    "\r",
    "* feat(routing): add tests for toggle\r",
    "\r",
    "* chore: prettier\r",
    "\r",
    "* fix: move router -> routers, stateMapping -> stateMappings\r",
    "\r",
    "And also the namespace when using InstantSearch without a package\r",
    "manager is routers not routing\r",
    "\r",
    "* chore: rename writeTimeout => writeDelay\r",
    "\r",
    "* chore: rename titleFromUIState into windowTitle\r",
    "\r",
    "* fix(routing): history routers should be robust by default\r",
    "\r",
    "* fix(connectSortBySelector): correct behavior of default index\r",
    "\r",
    "Previously the index name used as the default was the one at the init.\r",
    "However this one is the one from the URL if provided. We should rely on\r",
    "the one provided on the instance of InstantSearch.\r",
    "\r",
    "For this purpose, I had to provide also an instance of InstantSearch in\r",
    "the test.\r",
    "\r",
    "* fix(connectToggle): was reseting the page\r",
    "\r",
    "This widget uses the Helper in order to modify the current value of the\r",
    "facet at init. This resets the page to 0. Now it stores the currrent\r",
    "page before and reapply it after.\r",
    "\r",
    "* fix(routing): hierarchicalMenu.getWidgetState should keep other entries\r",
    "\r",
    "* chore: add some comments to the tests\r",
    "\r",
    "* chore: prettier\r",
    "\r",
    "* fix(rangeSlider): handles were blocked (#2849)\r",
    "\r",
    "This was because rheostat (our preact version) was using incompatible\r",
    "versions from ours (preact and preact-compat).\r",
    "\r",
    "This PR makes sure that we are using the same exact version as the min.\r",
    "for rhoestat in order to end up with the same dependencies when resolving\r",
    "the dependencies.\r",
    "\r",
